        "section": "behavioral-economics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Market Anomalies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONNECTION TO FINANCE/:\n  Equity premium is the central puzzle in quantitative finance.\n  The behavioral explanation (myopic loss aversion) is elegant:\n  λ from laboratory experiments (Kahneman-Tversky) × observed evaluation frequency\n  → observed market premium. Cross-disciplinary validation.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MARKET-ANOMALIES.md#011",
      "path": [
        "08-MARKET-ANOMALIES.md"
      ],
